+test, race, coverage numbers, os×package fixture matrix, fuzz smoke, capability-claims, windows compile-only, terminal verdict), plus a README gates section and logbook entry. `secprim`/`secconftest` production untouched; no foreign guard weakened.\\\\n\\\\nEvidence: 11 of 11 AC rows driven through named production entry points; mutant battery 13 applied / 0 NOT_APPLIED / 0 COMPILE_FAIL with 11 killed (5 narrowing + 6 arm-deletion) and 2 census-only survivors with stated bounds; every job proven by a deliberate red with recorded exit codes. Verification: 22 packages ok, `-race` 22 ok, `-cover` 22 lines, vet both GOOS, gofmt, catalog freshness, and tracecheck all green. Candidate tree `7be8309b01f900f0162f1bc525e98ca857fcc853` matches the outcome doc; three task-scoped artifacts attached (`ci-gates.md`, `mutants.log`, `verify.log`).\\\\n\\\\nTwo load-bearing finds on the way: unmatched `-fuzz` exits 0, so smoke jobs now require the engine-elapsed line; and a first-draft `cmd/cigate` tripped the specdoc mains guard, so gates ship as a library driven by name-guarded test selections instead — recorded as a deliberate decision.\\\",\\\"reason\\\":null}}\\n===\\n7f90e58 TASK-260830-7a0s2c: TASK-260830-7a0s2c: build-fixture-fuzz-and-fault-test-infrastructure\\n722ed1a TASK-260830-2ciy0s: TASK-260830-2ciy0s: implement-safe-path-argv-and-environment-primitives\\n157a54c Record STORY-260830-3drr2m board state\\n7f90e5858cd8346228f7aa687252266f1c133244\\n7be8309b01f900f0162f1bc525e98ca857fcc853\\n M .github/workflows/ci.yml\\n M LOGBOOK.md\\n M README.md\\n?? internal/cigate/\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 25377,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 6345,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
